Every unseen ultimate press made whatever the replay's energy (2026-11-24, misprediction candidates).

What: replayedSkill makes a logged ultimate press whose hits had no one to land on (`unseen`) even when the replay's
energy is short, not only one before the log's first hit (ReplayedCast.beforeHits, adopted in f3a6ecc for 9c0b's Si).

Measure (against e9e89ce's snapshots, beside the adopted beforeHits rule's): development 11 better, 1 worse, 2 mixed
(9c0b plain 367 → 410, 9c6e −12.6 → +4.7%, d774 plain 374 → 382 but damage 7.2 → 8.7%; worse 1cd1 plain 182 → 181,
