8.5 → 9.2% (the beforeHits rule alone: 8.5%).

Dropped: a later unseen ultimate press is often one the game didn't make (or made elsewhere); the energy check is
right more often than not there. Would need: which unseen presses the log shows nothing of because the enemy was away
(d774's) against ones that weren't casts at all (1cd1's).

